{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S07把亲密带来的欢喜转向了对方是否也需要他、是否能从他身上获得安心，开始以相互需要作为关系价值的确认，而不只是体验亲密本身。\",\n    \"S09把失去的恐惧具体化为对方不再需要他的陪伴，偏向担心自己失去被需要的位置，而不是亲密时光本身无法留住。\",\n    \"S11把欢喜后的痛楚落在对方以后还愿不愿意让他陪伴，进一步将核心转向对方是否继续需要自己。\",\n    \"S13想得到对方以后不会改变的保证，也主要围绕被需要、被留下的安全感展开，使留不住亲密的痛楚部分变成了对关系稳定性的焦虑。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S13仍然把一部分痛楚落在对方以后不再需要他、以及少表达心意能否减少受伤的顾虑上，略微带入了被需要与自我保护这一相邻主题。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y始终把亲密本身的甜蜜、珍惜、时间流逝和无法留住连在一起，尤其S11明确让无法留住亲密时光成为欢喜之后的痛楚，S13又让越喜欢越舍不得与越觉得时间匆促相互推动。X则多次把痛楚转向对方是否需要自己、是否愿意继续接受陪伴，使主线部分偏成了对自身关系位置的担忧。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6a05f851-6431-4cf0-8714-25d81682a04b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T103100017610Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:31:21.997247+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "aea37b7f0a32222eba7d8b26014b3e57ee39702b1a47a99139300fd0ba507142", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\cha